[166.459715, "o", "ion modules with rank 8 and alpha 16.\r\n\r\n**3. Merged model** — LoRA weights merged into the base model and saved to `/app/merged_model/`. The merged model loads cleanly from disk with `num_labels=20`.\r\n\r\n**4. Detection results** — All 10 test samples classified with high confidence (0.936–0.997):\r\n\r\n| Text | Class | Confidence |\r\n|------|-------|------------|\r\n| French | 6 | 0.975 |\r\n| Spanish | 5 | 0.989 |\r\n| German | 2 | 0.997 |\r\n| Italian | 8 | 0.989 |\r\n| Portuguese | 12 | 0.990 |\r\n| Russian | 13 | 0.986 |\r\n| Japanese | 9 | 0.965 |\r\n| Chinese | 19 | 0.936 |\r\n| Arabic | 0 | 0.988 |\r\n| English | 4 | 0.974 |\r\n\r\nResults saved to `/app/detection_results.json` in the required format.\r\n\r\n[result] role=implementor model=qwen3.6-35b tools=19 surface=a5d46c1799a3\r\n"]
